    "Validation selection is optimistic; requires fresh untouched evaluation before claiming an accuracy gain.",
    "Repeated users across histories make query bootstrap intervals descriptive and not independent-user significance tests.",
    "Aggregate reviewer approval reflects selection, exposure, era and review participation; not a personalized enjoyment probability.",
    "Count/logcount are separate notability/exposure channels; observed approval is a different signal.",
    "Counts cover training-selected 1500-item universe, not the full catalog."
  ],
